        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, your mission targets a criminal network within a prestigious hospital: Amox Dexter: A VIP patient and cunning cowboy tycoon exploiting the hospital for money laundering. Yuki Yamazaki: Shrewd lawyer with Yakuza ties, manipulating the hospital for criminal ends. End her schemes and connections. Akira Namura: Hospital director orchestrating organ trafficking. Expose his dark agenda to protect the vulnerable. Katashito: Ruthless organ thief preying on patients. And end KAI. Good luck, 47.",
